# Project structure

Follow `.cursor/skills/project-structure/SKILL.md` when adding features, placing files, or naming modules.

Hard rules:

- kebab-case **files and folders**; PascalCase **component exports**
- Screens live in `src/app/features/<feature>/` (`shell.tsx`, `list.tsx`, `login.tsx`, …)
- Routes are composed in `src/app/router/` (lazy-loaded screens, paths from `CONSTANTS.ROUTES`)
- APIs and models in `src/lib/apis/`; no `src/pages/`, `src/api/`, or PascalCase `*Page.tsx`
- Folders are roles; recipes choose libraries (e.g. store, schema, HTTP client)
- Prefer `type` over `interface`; path alias `@/*` → `src/*`
